'''Bat''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 20th tier in the Zombies Rewards for 50,000 [[Candies (2022)|Candies]] {{Currency|Candies2022}} during the [[Halloween Event 2022|2022 Halloween Event]]. It is now obtainable through [[trading]] as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
It resembles a wooden apocalyptic spiked baseball bat, hence the name. The barrel of the baseball bat has sharp gray spikes all over it placed asymmetrically. It has a metal grip and a circular wooden knob.

==Trivia==

* Only players who joined the Zombies team were able to purchase this knife.
* This, [[Candy]], [[BattleAxe]], [[BattleAxe II]], [[Turkey]], [[Evergreen]], [[Heart Wand]], [[Embersickle]] and [[icecream]] are the only godly "[[knives]]" that do not resemble knives.
* It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Makeshift]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Bat Set|Bat Set]].
